  "title": "Carrot and Walnut Cake",
  "description": "A nice carrot and walnut cake with a slight taste of spice due to some spices like cardamom. It's not too sweet and the count of calories is moderate.",
  "authors": [
    "Murooj Ibraheem"
  ],
